        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we do not have the capabilities to manufacture biologics or finished drug products for our development programs, we utilize contract manufacturers to manufacture all components of our drug candidates and our finished drug products, and we believe that they have sufficient capacity to meet our demands.",
