        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Before the sale of the Facility, as a manufacturer of PEG reagents for clinical drug candidates and commercial drug products, we were subject to inspections generally applicable to manufacturers of important components of pharmaceuticals, particularly inspections carried out by the FDA and the U.S.",
